 /rsvp_boot?id=1631843\n\nDescription:\nWhat does it take to sustain our lo
 cal food systems?\nRSVP your transportation spot on https://forms.gle/wB2c
 xJjDukN7wHmr6\nRoots of Labor connects Dartmouth students with the Upper V
 alley farmworker community through a guided visit to the Dartmouth Organic
  Farm and conversation with farmworkers. Participants will hear from membe
 rs of the community whose work sustains local food systems while reflectin
 g on labor justice\, dignity\, interdependence\, and community resilience.
 \nThe guided visit begins at 5:00 PM\, with transportation returning to ca
 mpus at approximately 7:00 PM\nOpen to campus\nFood Provided (Pizza-making
  supplies provided)\n\nSponsor / organizer: Office of Pluralism and Leader
 ship\n\nSource: Dartmouth Groups\n\nWhy this was included: Free Food categ
