 /rsvp_boot?id=1632431\n\nDescription:\nJoin the Women of Color Collective 
 (WoCC) as we kick off the new term by coming together\, getting to know ou
 r new Executive Board\, and setting intentions for the months ahead! This 
 will be a space to connect with other women of color and allies\, discuss 
 what we want for ourselves this term\, and think about the community we wa
 nt to continue building together.\nWe will create vision boards centered a
 round our personal and academic goals\, write letters to our future selves
 \, and put together goodie bags filled with encouraging notes from the WoC
 C Executive Board. Whether you have a clear vision for the term or are sti
 ll figuring it out\, come spend time with us\, meet the WoCC community\, a
 nd leave with a little reminder that you are supported and never growing a
 lone.\nFood Provided\n\nSponsor / organizer: Undergraduate Women of Color 
