 nt?event=81940\nhttps://libcal.dartmouth.edu/event/17014378\n\nDescription
 :\nThink you know your retention schedules? Play bingo using the General R
 etention Schedule\, build familiarity with the tool\, and make smarter kee
 p-or-delete decisions.\n🎉 Join in person for:\n• Real daubers\n• Fr
 ee popcorn\n• Limited-edition lenticular stickers\n• A chance to win a
  $20 Still North gift card\nEach bingo square is a question you'll answer 
 using the General Retention Schedule (GRS)\, Dartmouth's guide to records 
 common across campus\, which will be accessible during the session.\n📋 
 Sample square: How long must waivers be retained before deletion? Four yea
 rs.\nThere will also be some time to field questions about how the GRS app
 lies to your work.\nPlease register\nhere\n.\n\nSponsor / organizer: Libra
 ry\n\nAudience: Staff\n\nSource: Dartmouth\n\nWhy this was included: food 
